;   - Other cylinders at position 0: de-assert PORTB.1 (clear)
;   - Read 3 knock data bits from PORTB into var_knock_info:
;       PORTB.5 high  -> knock_info bit 3
;       PORTB.4 low   -> knock_info bit 1
;       PORTB.3 low   -> knock_info bit 0
