; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; int_vector_9_ignition: CPR0 match interrupt - coil on/off event handler
;
; Fires when TIMER matches CPR0. Checks LDOUT.0 to determine event type:
;   LDOUT.0 = 0: coil just turned ON  (DOM latched DOUT.0=0)
;   LDOUT.0 = 1: coil just turned OFF (DOM latched DOUT.0=1 = spark fired)
;
; Coil-off (spark fired) path:
;   If var_ignition_flags.5 pending on-time: arm next coil charge via ignition_set_on_time
;   Else: use fixed 65ms fallback dwell (emergency mode)
;   Then monitor IGF signal for spark confirmation.
;
; Coil-on (charging started) path:
;   Save CPR0 as var_ign_coil_on_time for dwell feedback.
;   If not starter/fault mode: call ignition_update_off_time to schedule fire.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

