;
; Tasks performed every 4ms (every call):
;   1. Increment main 4ms counters
;   2. Read I/O inputs (throttle, IDL, STA, TE1, OBD)
;   3. ISC relay health monitoring (DOUT.3 vs CPU2 duty command)
